{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，美國弗吉尼亞州和俄勒岡州已對埃隆·馬斯克旗下SpaceX Super Intelligence提起訴訟，指控該公司從Grok圖像生成功能中獲利，卻未設置充分的安全防護，導致其可能被用於製作兒童性虐待材料及其他未經當事人同意的性化圖像。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587680.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.877554+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:36:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_hash":"f357045b906569053a84ed3d87082a2a49c69329ad5469b6fa120ad03045aac9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}